	(text "HS20 SURUCU SABLONU - 2ED2410-EM (2 kanal / entegre, ~20 A)\nHIGH_SIDE_20A icinde 2 kez kullanilir (HS20_DRV0: kanal 0-1, HS20_DRV1: kanal 2-3).\nIcerik: 2ED2410-EM, 2x IAUC120N06S5N015 (60 V, 1,5 mohm), 2x shunt, boost bobini (SW/RS/BC), NTC (TMP)\nINA/INB: MCU PWM, EN: ortak enable, ISA/ISB (CSO1/CSO2): akim olcumu -> ADC\nINT: acik drain kesme -> MCU, OUTA/OUTB: yuk cikislari"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5add2e2f-dc92-4e33-a85c-28e577999681")
	)
